  m_text: "<b >Congratulations!</b><size=12 >/n</size>You won an Oxbow Lake</b><size=12
    >/n </size>River meanders (curves) cause erosion where the river hits the river
    bank.</b><size=12 >/n</size>Eventually this cuts off the meander forming an Oxbow
    lake. \n\n "
