  m_text: "Oh dear!</b><size=12 >/n </size>You didn't win the Underground River</b><size=12
    >/n</size>Difference in rock hardness above and below ground can cause the river
    to erode underground.</b><size=12 >/n </size>Beautiful features can form such
    as caves and stalactites.</b>\n "
